# Trace metals: solar abundances (Asplund+2009 number ratios to H).
# Each value is the TOTAL element abundance n_X/n_H (all ionization
# stages summed); the ionization-equilibrium solver distributes it over
# the ion stages. Bare element symbols are used to avoid the impression
# that e.g. "MgI" means only neutral Mg.
# EXHALE reads this at runtime (no recompile); remove the file to
# run metals-off.
# C/N/O are the Phase-1 coolants; Mg/Ca/Na/Fe add the Phase-2 CHIANTI
# line coolants (Mg I 2853, Mg II h&k, Ca II H&K, Na I D, Fe II coronal).
C     2.69e-4
N     6.76e-5
O     4.90e-4
Mg    3.98e-5
Ca    2.19e-6
Na    1.74e-6
Fe    3.16e-5
pp_metals 1
cno_cool 0
